A reference that matches says nothing about the ones after it. With this line restored, a file
whose SECOND reference over-counts comes back with Exif bytes while libheif refuses the file
outright — an unreadable original reported as a successful metadata read, and the fallback that
would have raised for it skipped. The probe is the fixture whose damage sits AFTER the match; the
one whose damage sits before it is the control and must stay green.

